BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 713.0 Td (3. Convert to a percent: 0.15 x 100% = 15%.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 699.0 Td (Answer: The increase is 15% of the original amount.) Tj ET
